                  <nc xml:id="m-888fd54e-accf-419a-ac33-462fd4bfe75f" pname="a" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-48823e7e-6b47-439a-8f75-d6bb0d214436" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-ebdf59ae-1e96-465f-bcf1-e3511bf7cbe6"><lg xml:id="m-c265cc0a-3da7-4610-a5b1-30888b0e8974"><l xml:id="m-5d253be4-9541-4314-b1cd-d80df5eda1ff" facs="#m-176b4086-f7b4-4ab2-b8ab-8ab0af6e30a3" label="text-like">Proper feasts of U. S. A.</l><l xml:id="m-d7461e83-4c8c-4f25-ba93-7f2bc5587198" facs="#m-91e53d2d-28b8-4eb8-b603-116cb2f74452" label="ambiguous">(42)</l><l xml:id="m-b7b15460-277d-44ba-85d3-9b24f89245b7" facs="#m-9a9ab249-223d-4707-8f70-ab0d97e1605c" label="ambiguous">MAY 23</l><l xml:id="m-dc727244-9e8a-4534-9c71-0af9a8e46c3d" facs="#m-3ff9280e-7ce8-4d5d-b914-af53df9c5022" label="ambiguous">St. John Baptist Di Rossi, Confessor</l><l xml:id="m-049ae59d-e62f-4bbd-8e99-e5a3b5d062a2" facs="#m-6f90260f-01c7-4fa7-b9ff-999a624402e8" label="ambiguous">I class</l><l xml:id="m-ecdc31d5-9dc1-4fba-82ea-dcd4a8782b82" facs="#m-5b629044-b97f-4865-b99f-11125fd8159b" label="ambiguous">In some dioceses</l><l xml:id="m-bc565925-b1b8-4459-9ccf-147132348d0c" facs="#m-165e8684-728f-476b-989e-c40a66f36224" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. p. 1200, except :</l><l xml:id="m-3a3eb427-c3c0-435d-8616-8b6e3ba11708" facs="#m-4f7c6790-e4aa-4348-956e-36feabb8853e" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-b824200a-4dd6-464c-9941-292c4d37e514" facs="#m-4bcbe657-c566-4a89-8ea1-a259f67cdb32" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui sanctum Joánnem [concéde, quaésumus; ut, cujus</l><l xml:id="m-9539bb5d-c131-4994-ae8e-f98a9892e648" facs="#m-2a73cea2-8e6b-4435-9e17-4e6fb4d64a5c" label="lyrics-like">U BaptistamConfessóremtuuml pia mérita venerámur. *virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-be0c0407-f914-4ff8-9ad5-2665e18ba997" facs="#m-302a8179-7e5f-4d25-8b4f-e0064703ef7c" label="lyrics-like">in evangelizándis paupéribus ca¬ tum quoque imitémur exémpla.</l><l xml:id="m-47191e5e-974b-40c7-834e-0df1ec1bc059" facs="#m-7abee1d5-daa0-4f5a-a781-85442cd0335b" label="lyrics-like">ritáte et patiéntia decorásti:tPer Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2c19b02f-03ac-4649-a8ed-74f8cb5d64b8" facs="#m-37564823-49e5-43cd-95b4-0205caca8dd1" label="text-like">In the diocese of Los Angeles and some others, Proper Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-9211cbbe-cd57-42fb-a108-128426ddb88f" facs="#m-b3bab3d5-1ff3-46ee-a262-1a80450f7fb4" label="lyrics-like">Collect. Deus, qui sanctum Joánnem. as above.</l><l xml:id="m-71b98d9a-2683-4aec-9251-b7add3e47d29" facs="#m-abfbd28b-3795-44d1-b024-8ef6cfd6177f" label="ambiguous">Secret</l><l xml:id="m-faa47c6d-205c-45de-9f86-a1398379fe51" facs="#m-5d3a03b0-fa90-4e9d-86ee-6c893fbc5839" label="lyrics-like">Blátum tibi munus, quaésu-¡Joánne Baptista Confessóre tuo</l><l xml:id="m-aad10711-c8fe-438b-a779-b4bda91ce43e" facs="#m-9952dbb8-c786-4c6a-9a0f-9852be1520e8" label="lyrics-like">Umus, Dómine, in odórem lintercedénte, nos córpore et</l><l xml:id="m-b0893a81-ab92-4201-8380-aac86a867238" facs="#m-bf781717-c74d-410a-89ba-0e9fde2db2aa" label="lyrics-like">suavitátis ascéndat: et, sancto! mente puríficet. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-76d1f18a-669c-4e71-a03a-bc84b82e3dc9" facs="#m-c6194d9d-91c8-44fb-9f74-a5bf887bc7c4" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion</l><l xml:id="m-3145390b-6920-417e-891d-0d9a3d9dfeba" facs="#m-20530c8d-0b09-403a-99d6-0d9ab0bce2af" label="lyrics-like">(Aeléstis, Dómine, participátio! mundet et múniat: ac bonis</l><l xml:id="m-074e3643-f273-4f79-a273-85685e749556" facs="#m-6ab36cc3-67a9-4de1-a03b-94ea80c1543c" label="lyrics-like">Lsacraménti, sancti Joánnis opéribus júgiter praestet esse</l><l xml:id="m-6d8f0bc5-eea9-4f65-bb01-12159f983d30" facs="#m-a4fdd15d-7507-4a68-b01d-154198f6e992" label="lyrics-like">Baptistae Confessóris tui suffra-inténtos. Per Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-7b811ea5-72ed-42aa-9c0e-f89cdf3dd91d" facs="#m-cdaddf39-f599-4cd3-857d-c81507203ce6" label="lyrics-like">gántibus méritis, fidéles tuos strum.</l><l xml:id="m-f5dbc3ea-cabf-4ea1-bc5a-ac16d5a6c9eb" facs="#m-55056a5a-1c4d-41e5-8b55-8572fd4614e7" label="ambiguous">MAY 25</l><l xml:id="m-519c65c9-2352-489b-a263-60138487e1c8" facs="#m-90cdfe4a-4b3c-4e27-ac5b-2cf9493c0f14" label="ambiguous">St. Madeleine-Sophie Barat, Virgin</l><l xml:id="m-50f10e84-b5f7-464c-8505-ab22ba4bca24" facs="#m-bcd64d0c-023f-4a87-8f07-efce5bae38ac" label="text-like">Foundress of the Society of the Religions of the Sacred Heart</l><l xml:id="m-ee88f270-5d4c-4d34-953a-26521f0ceb7c" facs="#m-41b956e4-2713-4b28-9392-0716ca68fc78" label="text-like">AT MASS</l><l xml:id="m-c653dc59-752e-4884-bb2b-e29ea79f0091" facs="#m-b1f3762b-04eb-4c9c-a463-16054315ff80" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-423e1798-5330-4d0d-9bd5-71a13bb0d540" facs="#m-eceb89aa-9b79-4cbe-94ce-5af1120142b7" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-ac0ce5c3-4527-440a-bb4b-78c55430d909" facs="#m-2d281cb3-9494-487b-a6de-4c680f93e19d" label="lyrics-like">One me“ ut signá-cu-lum super cor tú¬ um,</l><l xml:id="m-f62581c5-f004-470b-b4c7-b690e6d7e782" facs="#m-6977e984-178b-474e-a3d0-7240d5e73d32" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-bdf257fd-6f87-4d80-87a8-a4b54d1b2f0c" facs="#m-b0421bbf-46c2-44f3-9f8a-80d2401adf9b" label="lyrics-like">ut signáculum super bráchi¬ um tú¬ um: qui-a fórtis</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>